# Contact & Demo lead forms are handled by Web3Forms (client-side).
# The access key is public and currently set in lib/web3forms.ts, so no
# environment variables are required to run the site.
#
# To change the destination inbox, update WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY in
# lib/web3forms.ts with the key from https://web3forms.com (the email that
# receives leads is the one registered for that key on the Web3Forms dashboard).
